# Large solver output stays local. Per Next-Steps-Sonnet.md section 0, only *.s2p/*.s4p, summary.csv,
# solver*.log and run.txt are committed for a run.
**/exc*/
**/*.kicad_pcb
**/farfield_*.json
**/model.json
**/lines.json
# A model.json or lines.json already committed under results/_keep/ before this rule predates it and stays
# tracked (this ignore only stops NEW ones from being added); it was force-added, see git log.
# The repository root ignores *.log; solver logs are small and are the evidence for each run, so keep them.
!**/solver*.log
